IMPORT `cpp-core`
IMPORT `cpp-core-age`
IMPORT `cp4-nouns`
IMPORT `cp4-pension-index`

-- Canada Pension Plan Act, sections 59.1 and 59.2 -- THE POST-RETIREMENT BENEFIT AND THE POST-RETIREMENT
-- DISABILITY BENEFIT.
--
-- A post-retirement benefit (paragraph 44(1)(g), piece cp3) tops up the retirement pension of a person who
-- keeps working and contributing. It is the aggregate of three portions, one for the base contributions
-- (subsection (1.1)), one for the first additional (subsection (3)) and one for the second additional
-- (subsection (5)), each of the shape [(A x F/B) x C x D x E]/12. A post-retirement disability benefit
-- (paragraph 44(1)(h)) is a flat monthly amount indexed every year from 2019.
--
-- Out of range, taken as plain inputs: the amounts under sections 53, 53.1 and 53.2 (A); the Year's Maximum
-- Pensionable Earnings (s 18) and the Year's Additional Maximum Pensionable Earnings (s 18.1), piece cp1; the
-- Maximum Pensionable Earnings Average (s 42(1)); the adjustment factor of subsection 46(3) or (3.1), which
-- depends on age on 1 January (piece cp3, and regs 78.3 and 78.4, piece cr2); the earnings G and H of
-- paragraphs 53(1)(b)(i) and (ii) and their parallels (piece cp3); the Pension Index (s 43, piece cp3).

§ `Section 59.1 -- post-retirement benefit`

§§ `The shape of each portion`

-- Not a provision: [(A x F/B) x C x D x E]/12 with F = G/H, the shape common to subsections (1.1), (3) and (5).
-- NOTHING where the text defines no F or no ratio to B (H or B is zero). Where A is zero there are no such
-- earnings to count, and the portion is 0 whatever F is (NOTES.md, fork register).
GIVEN a IS A NUMBER
      g IS A NUMBER
      h IS A NUMBER
      b IS A NUMBER
      c IS A NUMBER
      d IS A NUMBER
      e IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`cp4 a portion of a post-retirement benefit` a g h b c d e MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF a EQUALS 0 THEN JUST 0
        IF (b EQUALS 0) OR (h EQUALS 0) THEN NOTHING
        OTHERWISE JUST ((((a TIMES (g DIVIDED BY h)) DIVIDED BY b) TIMES c TIMES d TIMES e) DIVIDED BY 12)

§§ `Section 59.1(1.1) and (2) -- the base portion`

-- src:1941 | Calculation of portion of post-retirement benefit
-- src:1942 | (1.1) Subject to subsections (2) and (7), the amount that is to be used for the purpose of subsection (1) is determined by the formula
-- src:1943 | [(A × F/B) × C × D × E]/12
-- src:1944 | where
-- src:1945 | A is the amount determined under subsection 53(1) for the year before the year in which the post-retirement benefit commences to be payable;
-- src:1946 | B is the Year’s Maximum Pensionable Earnings for the year before the year in which the post-retirement benefit commences to be payable;
-- src:1947 | C is 0.00625;
-- src:1948 | D is the Maximum Pensionable Earnings Average for the year in which the post-retirement benefit commences to be payable;
-- src:1949 | E is the adjustment factor referred to in subsection 46(3) or (3.1), as the case may be, based on the age of the contributor on January 1 of the year in which the post-retirement benefit commences to be payable; and
-- src:1950 | F is the amount determined by the formula
-- src:1951 | G/H
-- src:1952 | where
-- src:1953 | G is the amount of the earnings referred to in subparagraph 53(1)(b)(i), and
-- src:1954 | H is the aggregate of the earnings referred to in subparagraph 53(1)(b)(i) and those referred to in subparagraph 53(1)(b)(ii).
@ref Act s 59.1(1.1) (src:1942-1954)
GIVEN a IS A NUMBER
      `the earnings referred to in subparagraph 53(1)(b)(i)` IS A NUMBER
      `the aggregate of the earnings referred to in subparagraphs 53(1)(b)(i) and (ii)` IS A NUMBER
      `the Year's Maximum Pensionable Earnings for the year before the year in which the post-retirement benefit commences to be payable` IS A NUMBER
      `the Maximum Pensionable Earnings Average for the year in which the post-retirement benefit commences to be payable` IS A NUMBER
      `the adjustment factor referred to in subsection 46(3) or (3.1)` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`s 59.1(1.1) — the base portion of a post-retirement benefit` a `the earnings referred to in subparagraph 53(1)(b)(i)` `the aggregate of the earnings referred to in subparagraphs 53(1)(b)(i) and (ii)` `the Year's Maximum Pensionable Earnings for the year before the year in which the post-retirement benefit commences to be payable` `the Maximum Pensionable Earnings Average for the year in which the post-retirement benefit commences to be payable` `the adjustment factor referred to in subsection 46(3) or (3.1)` MEANS
    -- A is the amount determined under subsection 53(1) for the year before (or as subsection (2) says); C is 0.00625.
    `cp4 a portion of a post-retirement benefit` a `the earnings referred to in subparagraph 53(1)(b)(i)` `the aggregate of the earnings referred to in subparagraphs 53(1)(b)(i) and (ii)` `the Year's Maximum Pensionable Earnings for the year before the year in which the post-retirement benefit commences to be payable` 0.00625 `the Maximum Pensionable Earnings Average for the year in which the post-retirement benefit commences to be payable` `the adjustment factor referred to in subsection 46(3) or (3.1)`

-- src:1955 | Base unadjusted pensionable earnings for year retirement pension becomes payable
-- src:1956 | (2) For the purpose of the calculation under subsection (1.1), if the contributor’s base unadjusted pensionable earnings are earned in the year in which the contributory period ends under subparagraph 49(b)(iii), the amount determined for A in that subsection is the greater of
-- src:1957 | (a) zero, and
-- src:1958 | (b) the amount that is calculated by subtracting the Year’s Maximum Pensionable Earnings for that year — multiplied by the number of months in the year before the retirement pension becomes payable and divided by 12 — from the amount determined under subsection 53(1).
@ref Act s 59.1(2) (src:1955-1958)
GIVEN `the contributor's base unadjusted pensionable earnings are earned in the year in which the contributory period ends under subparagraph 49(b)(iii)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the amount determined under subsection 53(1)` IS A NUMBER
      `the Year's Maximum Pensionable Earnings for that year` IS A NUMBER
      `the number of months in the year before the retirement pension becomes payable` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 59.1(2) — the amount used for A in subsection (1.1)` `the contributor's base unadjusted pensionable earnings are earned in the year in which the contributory period ends under subparagraph 49(b)(iii)` `the amount determined under subsection 53(1)` `the Year's Maximum Pensionable Earnings for that year` `the number of months in the year before the retirement pension becomes payable` MEANS
    IF `the contributor's base unadjusted pensionable earnings are earned in the year in which the contributory period ends under subparagraph 49(b)(iii)`
    THEN max 0 (`the amount determined under subsection 53(1)` MINUS ((`the Year's Maximum Pensionable Earnings for that year` TIMES `the number of months in the year before the retirement pension becomes payable`) DIVIDED BY 12))
    ELSE `the amount determined under subsection 53(1)`

§§ `Section 59.1(3) and (4) -- the first additional portion`

-- src:1960 | (3) Subject to subsections (4) and (7), the amount that is to be used for the purpose of subsection (1) is determined by the formula
-- src:1961 | [(A × F/B) × C × D × E]/12
-- src:1962 | where
-- src:1963 | A is the amount determined under subsection 53.1(1) for the year before the year in which the post-retirement benefit commences to be payable, except that
-- src:1964 | (a) if the post-retirement benefit commences in 2020, A is the amount for 2019, multiplied by 0.15,
-- src:1965 | (b) if the post-retirement benefit commences in 2021, A is the amount for 2020, multiplied by 0.3,
-- src:1966 | (c) if the post-retirement benefit commences in 2022, A is the amount for 2021, multiplied by 0.5, and
-- src:1967 | (d) if the post-retirement benefit commences in 2023, A is the amount for 2022, multiplied by 0.75;
-- src:1968 | B is the Year’s Maximum Pensionable Earnings for the year before the year in which the post-retirement benefit commences to be payable;
-- src:1969 | C is 0.00208;
-- src:1970 | D is the Maximum Pensionable Earnings Average for the year in which the post-retirement benefit commences to be payable;
-- src:1971 | E is the adjustment factor referred to in subsection 46(3.1), based on the age of the contributor on January 1 of the year in which the post-retirement benefit commences to be payable; and
-- src:1972 | F is the amount determined by the formula
-- src:1973 | G/H
-- src:1974 | where
-- src:1975 | G is the amount of the earnings referred to in subparagraph 53.1(1)(b)(i), and
-- src:1976 | H is the aggregate of the earnings referred to in subparagraph 53.1(1)(b)(i) and those referred to in subparagraph 53.1(1)(b)(ii).
@ref Act s 59.1(3) (src:1960-1967)
GIVEN `the year in which the post-retirement benefit commences to be payable` IS A NUMBER
      `the amount determined under subsection 53.1(1) for the year before the year in which the post-retirement benefit commences to be payable` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 59.1(3) — the amount A used in subsection (3) before subsection (4)` `the year in which the post-retirement benefit commences to be payable` `the amount determined under subsection 53.1(1) for the year before the year in which the post-retirement benefit commences to be payable` MEANS
    -- (a) to (d): in the first four years the amount for the year before is scaled up in steps.
    BRANCH
        IF `the year in which the post-retirement benefit commences to be payable` EQUALS 2020 THEN `the amount determined under subsection 53.1(1) for the year before the year in which the post-retirement benefit commences to be payable` TIMES 0.15
        IF `the year in which the post-retirement benefit commences to be payable` EQUALS 2021 THEN `the amount determined under subsection 53.1(1) for the year before the year in which the post-retirement benefit commences to be payable` TIMES 0.3
        IF `the year in which the post-retirement benefit commences to be payable` EQUALS 2022 THEN `the amount determined under subsection 53.1(1) for the year before the year in which the post-retirement benefit commences to be payable` TIMES 0.5
        IF `the year in which the post-retirement benefit commences to be payable` EQUALS 2023 THEN `the amount determined under subsection 53.1(1) for the year before the year in which the post-retirement benefit commences to be payable` TIMES 0.75
        OTHERWISE `the amount determined under subsection 53.1(1) for the year before the year in which the post-retirement benefit commences to be payable`

