@ref Act s 59.1(4) (src:1977-1980)
GIVEN `the contributor's first additional unadjusted pensionable earnings are earned in the year in which the first additional contributory period ends under paragraph 49.1(c)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the amount A determined under subsection (3)` IS A NUMBER
      `the amount determined under subsection 53.1(1)` IS A NUMBER
      `the Year's Maximum Pensionable Earnings for that year` IS A NUMBER
      `the number of months in the year before the retirement pension becomes payable` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 59.1(4) — the amount used for A in subsection (3)` `the contributor's first additional unadjusted pensionable earnings are earned in the year in which the first additional contributory period ends under paragraph 49.1(c)` `the amount A determined under subsection (3)` `the amount determined under subsection 53.1(1)` `the Year's Maximum Pensionable Earnings for that year` `the number of months in the year before the retirement pension becomes payable` MEANS
    -- "the amount determined for A in that subsection is the greater of ..." replaces A as subsection (3) fixed it
    -- (NOTES.md, fork register: the transitional multiplier of paragraphs (3)(a) to (d) is not applied again).
    IF `the contributor's first additional unadjusted pensionable earnings are earned in the year in which the first additional contributory period ends under paragraph 49.1(c)`
    THEN max 0 (`the amount determined under subsection 53.1(1)` MINUS ((`the Year's Maximum Pensionable Earnings for that year` TIMES `the number of months in the year before the retirement pension becomes payable`) DIVIDED BY 12))
    ELSE `the amount A determined under subsection (3)`

